messages.en:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Hey, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}. If you
could be any cake in the
world, {07 0b 00}what would you be?{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Kuule, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}. Kui sa
võiksid olla ükskõik milline
kook, {07 0b 00}mis sa oleksid?{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 0b 00}What, that bit about high
heels? {01 00 00 05 00}{07 06 00}You HAVE noticed I
don't wear shoes, right?
I mean, you can't even BUY
shoes in this stupid town,{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 15 00}so why would I care?{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 0b 00}Mida, see lugu kõrgetest
kontsadest? {01 00 00 05 00}{07 06 00}Sa ju märkasid,
et ma kingi ei kanna, eks?
Ma mõtlen, selles rumalas
linnas ei saa kingi ostagi,{01 00 00 05 00}
{07 15 00}nii et miks ma hooliksin?{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}Hey, don't freak out at me!{01 01 00}
{07 16 00}I'm just trying to help you!

{07 14 00}You're still into martial
arts, aren't you? With all
those high kicks and stuff?{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}Hei, ära karju mu peale!{01 01 00}
{07 16 00}Ma tahan ainult aidata!

{07 14 00}Sa oled ikka veel võitlus-
kunstide lainel, eks? Kõik
need kõrged löögid ja nii?{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 14 00}It's like you read my mind!
{07 14 00}Maybe I should start going
to your class, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{03 01 00 01}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 14 00}Sa nagu loeksid mu mõtteid!
{07 14 00}Ehk peaksin ma hakkama su
tundides käima, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{03 01 00 01}
